{"page":161,"verses":[{"verse_key":"7:82","surah":7,"ayah":82,"ar_uthmani":"وَمَا كَانَ جَوَابَ قَوْمِهِۦٓ إِلَّآ أَن قَالُوٓا۟ أَخْرِجُوهُم مِّن قَرْيَتِكُمْ ۖ إِنَّهُمْ أُنَاسٌ يَتَطَهَّرُونَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"The only response his people gave was to say [to one another], ‘Drive them out of your town! These men want to keep themselves chaste!’","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"وَمَا","en_gloss":"And not","transliteration":"wamā","verse_key":"7:82"},{"pos":2,"ar":"كَانَ","en_gloss":"was","transliteration":"kāna","verse_key":"7:82"},{"pos":3,"ar":"جَوَابَ","en_gloss":"(the) answer","transliteration":"jawāba","verse_key":"7:82"},{"pos":4,"ar":"قَوْمِهِۦٓ","en_gloss":"(of) his people","transliteration":"qawmihi","verse_key":"7:82"},{"pos":5,"ar":"إِلَّآ","en_gloss":"except","transliteration":"illā","verse_key":"7:82"},{"pos":6,"ar":"أَن","en_gloss":"that","transliteration":"an","verse_key":"7:82"},{"pos":7,"ar":"قَالُوٓا۟","en_gloss":"they said","transliteration":"qālū","verse_key":"7:82"},{"pos":8,"ar":"أَخْرِجُوهُم","en_gloss":"Drive them out","transliteration":"akhrijūhum","verse_key":"7:82"},{"pos":9,"ar":"مِّن","en_gloss":"of","transliteration":"min","verse_key":"7:82"},{"pos":10,"ar":"قَرْيَتِكُمْ ۖ","en_gloss":"your town","transliteration":"qaryatikum","verse_key":"7:82"},{"pos":11,"ar":"إِنَّهُمْ","en_gloss":"Indeed, they","transliteration":"innahum","verse_key":"7:82"},{"pos":12,"ar":"أُنَاسٌۭ","en_gloss":"(are) people","transliteration":"unāsun","verse_key":"7:82"},{"pos":13,"ar":"يَتَطَهَّرُونَ","en_gloss":"who keep themselves pure","transliteration":"yataṭahharūna","verse_key":"7:82"},{"pos":14,"ar":"٨٢","en_gloss":"(82)","transliteration":"","verse_key":"7:82"}]},{"verse_key":"7:83","surah":7,"ayah":83,"ar_uthmani":"فَأَنجَيْنَـٰهُ وَأَهْلَهُۥٓ إِلَّا ٱمْرَأَتَهُۥ كَانَتْ مِنَ ٱلْغَـٰبِرِينَ","en_translation_id":85,"en":"We saved him and his kinsfolk- apart from his wife who stayed behind-","words":[{"pos":1,"ar":"فَأَنجَيْنَـٰهُ","en_gloss":"So We s